      "type": "richText",
      "html": "<h2>Responsible Travel</h2><p>At OneTomorrow, we aspire to reduce our global footprint when travelling. By following a set of guidelines for conscientious travel, we hope to continue the increasing trend of travelling the world without bringing harm to the culture, environment, economies or locals of the places we visit. </p>",
